WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.000
Ah, what a great morning!

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.810
Suddenly: without warning.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.610
Quickly: with speed.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.530
Huh? What are you doing?

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.790
Preparing for class.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.040
We've been a bit busy lately.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.140
Not to mention our student council work.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.080
So I have to use whatever time I have.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.060
Wow,

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.770
no wonder you're the top student!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.100
Intelligence gives a woman beauty.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:31.240
You'll certainly grow into a fine lady.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.050
Oh, stop it, you're embarrassing me!

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:35.640
Hey!

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:37.480
It's you!

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.350
Morning, Ai!

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.120
Thank goodness I found you!

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:45.300
Here's your mommy.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.560
Aw, Ai!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.260
What a relief.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.880
The truth is,

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:57.060
I received word that a number of valuable accessories belonging to a Heian princess were discovered.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.850
I'm off to buy them,

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.870
so look after Ai for me.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:02.770
Sure...

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:03.740
Huh?!

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.950
W-Wait a minute!

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:07.650
We can't do this!

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.020
We have school today!

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.500
Hmm...

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.300
But there's nobody else I can trust.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:15.930
Besides,

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.320
doesn't she look so happy to be with her mommy?

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.730
Aww, so cute!

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:26.090
Bye now!

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:27.270
Wai—

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.270
He got us.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:30.570
What do we do?

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.870
Hey, Earth to you two!

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.760
Sure you aren't forgetting anyone?

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:46.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:51.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:53.610
Every day it sparkles

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:57.310
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:09.840
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:15.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:20.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:26.640
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:35.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.190
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:42.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.210
What's more than just cute

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:49.100
is our promise between girls

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:55.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:55.170 --> 00:03:01.040
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:12.970
Outrageous!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:12.970
Outrageous!

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.680
You want us to leave Ai with you two?

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:22.150
We'll take great care of her!

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:23.480
Can you really handle it?

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.780
What, you don't trust us?

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:29.620
You think we can't do anything alone?

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.560
We didn't mean that...

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:35.060
Then let's call Lance, too.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.500
Hello?

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.200
You can make calls?

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.400
Davi told us how!

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.410
Oh dear...

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.780
That sounds difficult.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.310
Can I go?

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.980
Of course.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.950
I flew at max speed!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.560
We can handle anything!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.490
Just leave it to us!

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:10.030
You got it!

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.560
I can't say no to that passion!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.460
Huh?

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.030
Yay!

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:14.830
There!

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.800
President!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.000
Listen to me!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.210
The soccer club's bein' total jerks!

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.280
Nuh-uh, the baseball club is!

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.080
Huh? Quit lyin'!

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.110
You first!

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.450
You wanna go, punk?

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.350
Stop!

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:33.650
Sportsmen shake hands before a match.

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:36.090
Now tell me what you were fighting over.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.390
S-Sure...

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:38.820
So what happened is...

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:42.030
Let's go to the student council room for now.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:48.970
So, you're disagreeing over who should use the field for morning practice.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:49.900
Yeah.

