00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.180
How's Ai doing?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.750
Good, you look happy.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.120
What happened here?

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:52.920
N-Nothing bad!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.930
We were just playing with Ai!

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.660
What did you play?

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.130
The room looks like a tornado hit it!

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.200
Did you <i>get</i> played with?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.880
Isn't it time for her milk?

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.110
Charles, if you'd please.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:14.780
Gotcha!

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:17.950
Charurules!

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.430
Huh? What's wrong?

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.870
Rikka!

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:37.400
Huh?

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:40.610
Umm, if a baby won't drink its milk,

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.970
that could mean... a bunch of different things...

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:45.640
I'm sorry!

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.450
I have no clue.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.150
No way!

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:55.550
Ai...

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.660
<i>Please...</i>

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:03.090
<i>don't cry. {What a nice way of telling the kid to shut up.}</i>

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.610
This is...

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.610
A new Lovies was born!

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:18.440
Let's try it out!

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:20.980
Yo! Checka Racka! {ヨー！　チェケラケ！. I don't fucking know.}{>Rachel says it >Her name starts with ラケ >yfw}

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.460
It turned into night...

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.370
Where'd that Lovies...

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:51.740
Maybe it was created from your feelings?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.910
Exactly!

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.620
Lovies come from the love in your heart!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.090
Or so Davi told us!

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:03.690
Huh?! I, uh...

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:05.620
Geez, Rachel!

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.890
Don't just hold on to info that important!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:11.960
We've gotta go!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.100
Keep it up, guys!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:18.900
Will do!

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:28.910
When she's calmed down,

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.320
she looks like an angel!

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:34.120
We should let her sleep for now.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.960
Somebody's coming!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.570
What're you doing?

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:58.110
You're gonna wake Ai up!

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:09.750
Student Council Room

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.750
Ai, shh!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.860
Someone'll come!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:13.730
Is somebody in here?

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.760
Be quiet!

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:28.170
Don't run off on us!

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.980
Rikka lied!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.350
She said nobody would come!

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:38.050
Well you're one to talk!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.590
She went in there!

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.830
Kyupirappa!

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:54.270
Hey!

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.400
Don't change your pose!

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.910
Why is it moving?!

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.710
Stop! Stop it!

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:12.080
And because of that...

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.520
All right, that's it for practice!

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:18.390
Right!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:20.990
Kyupirappa!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.400
Hey, I said practice was over!

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:37.540
Ai, wait! {Slam, bam, thank you ma'am.}

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.140
I wonder if Ai's still asleep.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.170
President!

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.580
What's wrong, everyone?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.640
We're haunted!

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:13.710
By ghosts!

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:14.910
Huh?

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.780
I was walking by an empty music room,

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.450
and then I heard something...

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.550
When I peeked inside,

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:25.520
I saw portraits of Beethoven, Chopin, and Mozart

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:28.990
flying with a bucket and singing in chorus!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:31.960
They were definitely chanting a curse!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:36.100
I saw a demonic ceremony in the library!

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:40.170
A bunch of books were floating around the room.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.670
Then a mop and some rags

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.780
suddenly transformed into pink, blue, and yellow monsters,

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.080
and started laughing evilly!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:52.280
Sharuruu, Keruu, Lansuu!

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:57.620
And the bucket made a "kyupi" sounding groan!

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:02.360
It's signaling the birth of this school's seven mysteries!

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.260
This has gotta be...

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.960
all their fault. {I can't make out the student's speech enough to translate it perfectly, but I can hear the male student say the next mystery involves toilets, and the female student say "You've thought about this a lot."}

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.200
Mana! Rikka!

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:15.810
Truth is...

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:16.670
Huh?

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.140
You lost Ai?!

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:21.110
We're sorry!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.410
Let's start looking!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:23.180
Yeah!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:28.250
Baseball Club Field Usage Schedule

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:28.250
Soccer Club Field Usage Schedule

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.190
Kyupirappa!

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:38.160
You did this, didn't you?

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:40.530
I was gonna say that!

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:41.570
What was that?

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:45.800
No way in heck am I sharing the field with you punks!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.100
Same here!

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:50.710
We need to use the field more!

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:58.580
Well, we're both weak clubs and first-match losers.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.420
Don't put it like that.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.650
Let's just talk it over again.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:07.430
Aw, talking it out's a pain.

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.660
Who's there?

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:11.260
If you want it, just take it.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:14.700
I shall grant your desire.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.750
Captain!

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:29.780
Go berserk!

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:32.950
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.320
Selfish!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.990
I'm a Selfish too!

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:44.960
Selfish Shot!

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:46.900
Selfish Home Run!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.330
Look!

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.910
There are two Selfishes!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.670
And they're fighting?

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.680
We've gotta stop them!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:58.910
Yeah.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.010
Lance, get Alice for us.

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:02.450
Roger that!

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.350
Let's go, Charles!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.120
Charles!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.180
Rachel!

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:08.350
Okay!

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.620
Charles!

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:15.930
Precure Love Link!

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:18.500
L-O-V-E!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:19.160
L-O-V-E!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:19.960
L-O-V-E!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.100
L-O-V-E!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:51.930
Brimming with love,

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.630
Cure Heart!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:57.570
Rachel!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:01.510
Precure Love Link!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:03.070
L-O-V-E!

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:03.710
L-O-V-E!

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:04.510
L-O-V-E!

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.480
L-O-V-E!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.330
The light of wisdom,

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.400
Cure Diamond!

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.440
Oh poor balls who have lost their love,

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.640
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:39.780
will make your hearts race once more!

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:42.950
Soccer!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.050
Baseball!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.790
Shut up!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:53.090
Children look up to baseball and soccer players!

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:56.760
If you fight over something so petty, you'll let them all down.

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:59.360
Kids care about soccer?

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:03.030
Scores get much higher in baseball, so it's way cooler!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.140
What're you talkin' about?

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:07.540
Soccer is totally cool!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.470
Huh?!

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:10.570
Your matches are too short!

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:13.310
Takin' forever doesn't make it good! {The irony being that soccer does in fact take forever}

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.210
Stop tha— Whoah!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.520
Go berserk, Selfishes!

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:22.490
Build egogy for King Selfish!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.620
Ai's over there!

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:32.500
Ai!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.500
Look out!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:44.310
Rigid Rosetta Wall!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.280
Self?

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.220
I arrived in the nick of time.

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:53.680
Cure Rosetta!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:54.790
Cure Sword!

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:57.720
I sensed a Selfish's presence, so I came to check.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.220
It doesn't matter if the whole gang's here.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:02.190
You got a lotta nerve!

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.930
Bullet Shot!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.100
You can't use your hands in soccer!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.000
Vanishing Pitch!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.380
No-Spin Shot! {Apparently a real thing. The lack of spin on the ball causes the trajectory to change in interesting ways, similar to a knuckleball in baseball, but I can't call it that for the reasons given two lines above.}

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.780
I can't read its trajectory!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.350
They're random, but strong!

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:28.950
We're in the World Cup!

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.720
We're in the Major League!

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.960
M-Mommy...

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:35.790
It's dangerous, so stay back!

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.600
Hey, Ai.

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.430
Don't worry.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:44.540
We'll beat those Selfishes up quick.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.340
And then we'll play together again!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.420
It's time to end this.

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.820
Finish those Precures off!

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:15.200
Kyupirappa!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.800
Ai?

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.640
We've been...

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:29.580
Given a speed boost!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:30.580
But...

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:33.280
I'm too fast to stop!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:37.450
What the heck?

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:39.390
Stop!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.760
Joy and sorrow are two sides of the same coin! {Uses an obscure idiom that basically means something like this. No idea why she'd use it, but okay.}

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:47.200
I don't care about your cups or leagues, {Alt. "I don't care if we're in the Worlds, Majors, or the Slam Jam!"}

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.900
but we're gonna play like a team!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:53.100
Everyone, move exactly as I say!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.840
All right!

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:58.610
We'll do it, Coach Diamond!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.950
Halftime's over, cannon shot!

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.850
Now, slide!

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.550
Now I'll counter...

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:09.850
with a goal!

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:11.620
Or so it's called.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.320
Self...

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:17.160
Sinker!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.760
Just bunt it!

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:21.130
Got it!

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:23.630
It's a grounder!

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:25.500
Run around! Hurry!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:28.540
F-Fast!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.180
An inside-the-parker?

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:37.250
What're you so down about?!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.880
Now, just to make sure!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:39.950
I've got it!

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:42.720
Charles!

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.400
From me to you,

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.660
My Sweet Heart!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:59.170
Love love looove!

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.110
Frack!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:08.050
How'd I lose with two of 'em?!

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:09.110
I'm out! {Alt. "Ragequit!"}

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:12.350
Ai!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.690
But that power she used...

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:18.390
Yes...

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:24.530
Ai may be hiding powers we can't even imagine.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:28.030
How're the two clubs doing?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:30.330
They're getting along again.

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.400
Today's been exhausting.

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:34.640
That's for sure.

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:39.380
If that guy hadn't asked something so demanding,

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:42.150
none of this mess would have happened.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:43.850
That's right.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:46.180
He's gonna be in for it when he gets back.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.850
Don't do that, Ai...

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:51.360
Please leggo of my ear...

00:21:51.360 --> 00:21:53.560
Quit complaining...

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:57.760
That's enough for today.

00:21:58.060 --> 00:22:01.030
Just leave it to us...

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:10.210
Wow! Makopi transferred into my school!

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:11.210
It's nice to meet you!

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:14.110
But I'm not used to going to school, so it's tough!

00:22:14.110 --> 00:22:16.550
Hey! Don't autograph the test!

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:19.820
Tabloid reporters are gathering outside the school!

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:21.150
Leave it to me!

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:22.650
As the student council secretary,

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:25.420
I'll protect our students' ways of life!

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:28.090
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.090 --> 00:22:31.500
The Transfer Student's

00:22:28.090 --> 00:22:31.500
The Transfer Student's

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:34.000
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
